      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#B3CFE0;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">About Us</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">About Kings Park Structural Co: What We Are, and What We're Not</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">We're a referral service, not an engineering firm. This page explains who actually does the work, how a careful engineer approaches a crack or a beam, and what you can check before you pay anyone.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
        <a href="tel:+61855506237" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (08) 5550 6237</a>
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get a Written Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-img" style="border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
      <img src="/images/about.webp" alt="About Kings Park Structural Co: What We Are, and What We're Not" width="800" height="533" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } .hero-img { max-height: 320px; } }
